# RESTLESS: the four weapons. The staff 8; the seeker ring 6 and turns
# toward foes, only the first two track far; the ember 10, its charge two
# fireballs in a helix; the scatter five pellets of 3 (4 charged), the
# charged ones hanging in the air a second and stopping foe shots.
game restless
wait 5
cheat half 0
cheat nospawn
cheat notimer
cheat god
cheat weapon 2
press A
expect shot0_dmg == 10
expect shot0_vx == 1280
expect shot0_life >= 30
wait 40
hold A 45
release
wait 1
expect shots == 2
expect shot0_dmg == 10
expect shot0_charged == 1
wait 60
cheat weapon 1
press A 1
press A 1
press A 1
expect shots == 3
expect shot0_dmg == 6
wait 30
expect shots == 2
wait 60
cheat weapon 3
press A
expect shots == 5
expect shot0_dmg == 3
wait 30
expect shots == 0
hold A 45
release
wait 1
expect shots == 5
expect shot0_dmg == 4
wait 18
expect hovering >= 4
# a foe shot into the hanging pellets is stopped
cheat eshot 0 160 127 -400 0
wait 20
expect eshots == 0
wait 60
expect hovering == 0
